    "reducedMotion": "The ring holds still: the phase is integrated from delta time, so freezing it is a matter of adding nothing. The dirty flag is then only set by the pointer, which means the renderer draws zero frames until the pointer moves. Picking, hover growth and selection are unaffected — the technique is about where things are, not about them moving.",
