    "reducedMotion": "No frame loop is opened. A single frame is drawn at `uElapsed = 1.9` — past the one-second amplitude ramp, and a third of the way through the default cycle, so the crest sits inside the lattice rather than off its edge. Both the depth falloff and the wave band are visible in that still; neither advances.",
