    "acceptance": "Watch for a full minute: the density pattern never obviously repeats, and no layer edge or gradient ellipse becomes visible at any point in the cycle. Content behind the smoke stays clickable. In a performance profile the frames show composite work only — no repaints of the blurred layers. With reduced motion on, the fog is still present and completely still.",
