    "reducedMotion": "Both layers get `display: none`, and `usePageCover` calls the commit synchronously rather than starting a timer. Navigation is a hard cut straight to the destination — no cover, no reveal, and crucially not a zero-duration overlay, which would still be one frame of opaque colour.",
