    "summary": "The counter, the word list and the exit wipe are three parts of a single `gsap.timeline`, not three independent animations racing each other. The number is tweened on a plain object with `power2.inOut`, so it accelerates and settles instead of ticking linearly — the difference between a loading count and a progress bar wearing a costume.",
